# An enduring story is had for the rest of the game (CR 702.195a-b; the rulings: "even if you lose control of some or all of
# your storied permanents"). Bot1 gets it with Fíli and two Moxes, and Bot2 then Bolts Fíli, a 3/3: Bot1 now controls only
# two qualifying permanents and no storied one, and still has the story. Fíli's +1/+1 went with Fíli (CR 611.3a): its Dwarf
# token is 2/2 again.

